ious biological functions, particularly in the context of parenteral nutrition. However, in the context of the provided descriptions, CU predominantly pertains to Colitis Ulcerosa.", "EC:EC, or Enfermedad de Crohn, is a type of inflammatory bowel disease characterized by its chronic nature. This condition can lead to malnutrition and necessitates a variety of treatment approaches to manage its symptoms and complications.", "BUDESONIDA:Budesonida is a corticosteroid that helps suppress inflammation in patients with inflammatory bowel disease.", "CLARITROMICINA:Claritromicina is an antibiotic that may be used in the treatment of severe inflammatory bowel disease."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}